**__pycache__**
**build**
**egg-info**
**dist**
data/
*.pyc
venv/
*.idea/
*.so
*.yaml
*.sh
*.pth
*.pkl
*.zip
*.bin
output
version.py

# Public release entry points (legacy experiments remain ignored above).
!configs/release/*.yaml
!scripts/release/*.sh
!docker/compose.yaml
!docker/*.example
!requirements/*.txt
!requirements/*.json

# Local research material is not part of the source release.
/docs/revision_*
/*.pdf
*.docx
/checkpoints/
/release-dist/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!docker/.env.example
.vscode/
.venv/

